## In order to run the code 
##Put your data in Data Folder save it by name of crop and name each chromosome .fasta file as chr1.fasta, chr2.fasta, etc
use command: make clean to remove all extra files generated
type command : make
followed by: ./main


fischer & chi square: use values generated by main program in "Fischer_and_Chi_Square.ipynb" and run to generate pvalues

cluster.py: run to generate heirarchical clustering/k-means clustering along with heatmap

To separate whole genome fasta into chr wise: run getchr.py

To delete generated .txt file: rm -f *.txt